      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能冻住对方\n可是很厉害的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80FD51BB4F4F5BF965B9000A53EF662F5F8853895BB37684FF0100100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为如果被冻住，\n你的宝可梦<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就无法动弹了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A5982679C88AB51BB4F4FFF0C000A4F6076845B9D53EF68A600100001BE00000A5C3165E06CD552A85F394E86FF0100100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "刚才是在模仿我憧憬的\n宝可梦训练家。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n那个人是冰属性的行家，\n我也对她有样学样哦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "521A624D662F57286A214EFF621161A761AC7684000A5B9D53EF68A68BAD7EC35BB6300200100001BE01000A90A34E2A4EBA662F51B05C5E60277684884C5BB6FF0C000A62114E5F5BF95979670968375B66683754E6300200100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎么样？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n你要不要用我派出的\n冰属性宝可梦凉快一下？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E4E486837FF1F00100001BE01000A4F6089814E0D8981752862116D3E51FA7684000A51B05C5E60275B9D53EF68A651C95FEB4E004E0BFF1F00100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是想打场对战凉快一下，\n就来找我哦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F60F36253573A5BF9621851C95FEB4E004E0BFF0C000A5C316765627E621154E6300200100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要和我派出的\n冰属性宝可梦对战吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981548C62116D3E51FA7684000A51B05C5E60275B9D53EF68A65BF962185417FF1F00100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不要",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D89810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太受凉对身体不好哦，\n等你有兴趣了再来找我吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A53D751C95BF98EAB4F534E0D597D54E6FF0C000A7B494F60670951748DA34E86518D6765627E62115427300200100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我终于能说出向往已久的台词了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117EC84E8E80FD8BF451FA54115F805DF24E45768453F08BCD4E86FF0100100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊哈哈！\n你做好觉悟了吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554A54C854C8FF01000A4F60505A597D89C9609F4E865427FF0100100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来你小有实力嘛！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n好吧……！\n你可以前往下一个房间了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B67654F605C0F67095B9E529B561BFF0100100001BE01000A597D542720262026FF01000A4F6053EF4EE5524D5F804E0B4E004E2A623F95F44E86FF0100100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎……\n我模仿得太过头了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE20262026000A62116A214EFF5F97592A8FC759344E86300200100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你好强啊！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n对了，宝可梦就算被冻住\n也会自然解冻的，所以放心吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60597D5F3A554AFF0100100001BE01000A5BF94E86FF0C5B9D53EF68A65C317B9788AB51BB4F4F000A4E5F4F1A81EA713689E351BB7684FF0C62404EE5653E5FC35427300200100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是宝可梦学会了\n火焰轮、蒸汽爆炸或者闪焰冲锋，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也可以用这些招式让冰融化。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F5B9D53EF68A65B664F1A4E86000A706B71308F6E300184B86C7D720670B86216800595EA713051B2950BFF0C00100001BE00000A4E5F53EF4EE575288FD94E9B62DB5F0F8BA951B0878D5316300200100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "话说回来，在密阿雷市竟然\n创造出了一个称为冰原也不为过的地方，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n这真是又神奇又美好啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BDD8BF456DE6765FF0C57285BC6963F96F75E027ADF7136000A521B902051FA4E864E004E2A79F04E3A51B0539F4E5F4E0D4E3A8FC77684573065B9FF0C00100001BE00000A8FD9771F662F53C8795E594753C87F8E597D554AFF0100100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "多亏了城市里增加的野生宝可梦，\n我们才能享受到丰富多彩的变化啊！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我打算和冰属性的宝可梦\n一起品尝格兰尼塔沙冰！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
